WEBVTT

00:00:09.615 --> 00:00:14.245
Hatenkou Yugi

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:18.556
Tabidachi wa sone totsuzen
The departure always comes unexpectedly

00:00:18.557 --> 00:00:22.027
Guzen no yona hitsuzen
It is destined to happen like a coincidence

00:00:22.027 --> 00:00:27.829
Mawari dashita unmei ga kishimu
Your evolving fate starts to grind

00:00:28.901 --> 00:00:32.268
Totsuzen no ame ni sozen
Confused by sudden rain

00:00:32.437 --> 00:00:35.706
Furarete zubunure bozen
Stunned by getting rejected and soaked in the rain

00:00:35.707 --> 00:00:41.805
Warai tobase michi wa hirakareru
Let’s laugh it off: a new path will open for you

00:00:42.447 --> 00:00:45.616
Muimi na koto ni kakusareteru
What’s the most precious thing

00:00:45.617 --> 00:00:49.187
Ichiban daiji na mono wa nani
That’s hidden behind meaningless things

00:00:49.187 --> 00:00:57.094
Kitto kiseki wa okosu mono waratte
You can make miracles happen, so keep smiling

00:00:57.763 --> 00:01:00.596
My Heartbreaking Romance

00:01:00.799 --> 00:01:04.836
Hajikeyo omou mama ni
Let’s go wild as you desire

00:01:04.836 --> 00:01:10.138
Omoshiro yukai sore ga kihon
Have a blast and live it up: that’s my style

00:01:11.043 --> 00:01:14.171
Kimi no Heartrending Sorrow
Your Heartrending Sorrow

00:01:14.479 --> 00:01:18.416
Ima wa mada furenai yo
| will leave it alone for now

00:01:18.417 --> 00:01:24.879
Mazu wa koko kara hajimeyo
So let’s begin our adventure right here

00:01:25.157 --> 00:01:29.992
Am | ever

00:01:32.197 --> 00:01:33.221
Dad?

00:01:34.666 --> 00:01:36.497
It’s been a while, Rahzel.

00:01:37.135 --> 00:01:41.504
A Fresént
For You

00:01:43.342 --> 00:01:46.004
Shall | gift-wrap it?

00:01:46.445 --> 00:01:48.470
Is it a birthday present?

00:01:49.081 --> 00:01:52.448
Yeah. It’s for the birthday of someone very special.

00:02:00.592 --> 00:02:02.856
Happy birthday!

00:02:04.329 --> 00:02:06.854
Happy birthday!

00:02:08.300 --> 00:02:10.902
My Princess!

00:02:10.902 --> 00:02:13.894
My Princess, happy birthday!

00:02:16.141 --> 00:02:17.442
Yay, yay, yay!

00:02:17.442 --> 00:02:19.243
Congrats! Congrats!

00:02:19.244 --> 00:02:22.042
Thanks! Thank you so much, everyone!

00:02:22.280 --> 00:02:24.548
Rahzel is extremely happy now!

00:02:24.549 --> 00:02:26.183
Yay!

00:02:26.184 --> 00:02:28.618
What's this celebration for?

00:02:29.087 --> 00:02:31.022
So, how old are you now?

00:02:33.392 --> 00:02:35.690
I’ve set out all these presents for you.

00:02:36.762 --> 00:02:38.696
Don’t ignore me and continue the conversation.

00:02:38.864 --> 00:02:42.000
And of course, | got you a present, too.

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:44.202
Thanks. Can | open it now?

00:02:44.202 --> 00:02:45.336
Go right ahead!

00:02:45.337 --> 00:02:46.133
As | said—

00:02:46.872 --> 00:02:48.737
Isn’t it obvious? It’s a birthday.

00:02:49.941 --> 00:02:50.771
For who?

00:02:51.009 --> 00:02:52.169
For Rahzel-chan.

00:02:53.011 --> 00:02:53.845
When?

00:02:53.845 --> 00:02:54.679
Today.

00:02:54.680 --> 00:02:55.881
No one told me that.

00:02:55.881 --> 00:02:56.813
You never asked.

00:02:57.249 --> 00:03:00.776
Besides, Al-kiddo and presents
don’t really go together.

00:03:01.053 --> 00:03:05.553
| doubt he knows what
a birthday party is to begin with.

00:03:05.757 --> 00:03:07.554
D-don’t patronize me!

00:03:07.759 --> 00:03:10.751
| can totally conquer a challenge like that.

00:03:10.996 --> 00:03:13.464
rll prepare what you call a “present.”

00:03:15.133 --> 00:03:17.301
Anyway, you really surprised me.

00:03:17.302 --> 00:03:20.362
| had no idea Heat-tan was Dad’s little brother.

00:03:20.572 --> 00:03:23.564
That makes us uncle and niece, right?

00:03:23.742 --> 00:03:25.937
| love how immoral it sounds.

00:03:26.812 --> 00:03:27.608
Heat-tan...

00:03:27.813 --> 00:03:28.643
Are you even listening?

00:03:28.814 --> 00:03:33.217
If you do naughty things to my daughter,
il literally tear you apart.

00:03:34.553 --> 00:03:36.248
You're funny, Bro.

00:03:37.055 --> 00:03:38.352
Your brother’s totally serious.

00:03:40.459 --> 00:03:41.721
Give it a rest!

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:43.394
Are you shutting me out?

00:03:43.395 --> 00:03:44.487
Don’t mess with me.

00:03:44.629 --> 00:03:45.596
I’m lonely.

00:03:45.897 --> 00:03:49.458
The fact that | feel disgusted
towards you guys isn’t a concern here.

00:03:49.601 --> 00:03:54.868
But before the party or presents,
isn’t there something more important?

00:03:55.407 --> 00:03:57.272
You better introduce yourself, at least.

00:03:57.876 --> 00:04:00.037
| don’t even know your name!

00:04:00.679 --> 00:04:04.274
Whoa, a sensible comment just came
from someone like Al-kiddo.

00:04:04.583 --> 00:04:07.177
This was unimaginable when | first met him.

00:04:07.519 --> 00:04:09.646
| guess humans do grow and evolve.

00:04:09.988 --> 00:04:13.719
No worries, Alzeid. Seeing you grow
is already a nice birthday present for me.

00:04:14.259 --> 00:04:15.760
Give it a rest already.

00:04:15.761 --> 00:04:18.025
Introduce myself? That’s not necessary.

00:04:18.597 --> 00:04:20.724
| have no intention of sharing my name with you.

00:04:21.266 --> 00:04:23.291
We'll never meet again anyway.

00:04:29.775 --> 00:04:31.299
Your journey ends here.

00:04:31.543 --> 00:04:32.908
I’m taking Rahzel home with me.

00:04:36.148 --> 00:04:41.745
Did you already know that that Serateed guy
was coming to take Rahzel back?

00:04:42.020 --> 00:04:44.352
Yeah, | suppose.

00:04:45.056 --> 00:04:46.489
Your journey ends here.

00:04:46.758 --> 00:04:48.157
I’m taking Rahzel home with me.

00:04:48.293 --> 00:04:51.524
Where did that come from, you pitiful man?

00:04:52.330 --> 00:04:56.664
“Go see the world...” Isn’t that what you said
and why you forcibly set me off on a journey, Dad?

00:04:57.302 --> 00:04:59.395
So what changed your mind?

00:05:00.739 --> 00:05:02.172
| can’t tell you that.

00:05:02.440 --> 00:05:05.375
Dad, | know that house belongs to you.

00:05:05.544 --> 00:05:06.670
It belongs to you, too.

00:05:06.978 --> 00:05:11.642
So even though it was unexpected,
you had the right to throw me out of it.

00:05:11.983 --> 00:05:16.087
But my existence, from the tip of my toes
to the last strand of my hair,

00:05:16.087 --> 00:05:17.918
is without a doubt my territory.

00:05:18.089 --> 00:05:19.681
Are you trying to invade that?

00:05:20.058 --> 00:05:22.686
Do you think you can control me?

00:05:22.861 --> 00:05:25.625
No. This is just my selfishness.

00:05:25.964 --> 00:05:28.398
Do you think I'll obey your selfishness?

00:05:28.967 --> 00:05:30.229
As a matter of fact, | do.

00:05:33.004 --> 00:05:35.905
Mind if | get some fresh air with these two?

00:05:38.043 --> 00:05:42.070
By the way, what would be good
for a birthday present?

00:05:42.380 --> 00:05:43.142
Huh?

00:05:44.649 --> 00:05:45.741
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:05:48.186 --> 00:05:49.483
Shall we go now?

00:05:58.964 --> 00:06:00.989
You want me to keep an eye on Soresta?

00:06:01.233 --> 00:06:06.865
Inside the military, there’s a faction
plotting a coup d’etat against the Royalty of Obplay.

00:06:07.405 --> 00:06:10.169
There’s a good chance
that he’s one of its main members.

00:06:10.375 --> 00:06:14.243
And you let him guard the prince knowing that?

00:06:14.880 --> 00:06:17.974
How can you use that little boy
as bait? How cruel.

00:06:18.250 --> 00:06:23.620
We're going to dangle the enticing next in line
for the throne, Prince Vincent, right in front of them.

00:06:23.955 --> 00:06:26.219
They’ll probably show their true colors.

00:06:26.625 --> 00:06:28.456
But | don’t get it, Bro.

00:06:28.894 --> 00:06:33.627
Apart from monitoring the prince’s guards
and killing them if necessary,

00:06:34.099 --> 00:06:38.229
why would you want me to lure
Alzeid to Soresta’s side?

00:06:38.503 --> 00:06:42.462
The reason I’m here now is to take Rahzel home.

00:06:42.841 --> 00:06:44.866
I’m just taking up the request
from Obplay while I’m at it.

00:06:45.143 --> 00:06:50.206
| figured | might as well help him
leave my daughter on his own.

00:06:50.882 --> 00:06:54.750
Dragging her away from her comrade
and having her hate me is the last thing | want.

00:06:55.053 --> 00:06:57.886
What if that’ll endanger your precious daughter?

00:06:59.424 --> 00:07:03.918
Don’t be silly. She wouldn’t be distracted
by scum like that.

00:07:04.162 --> 00:07:05.459
You never know.

00:07:05.830 --> 00:07:09.561
She might end up fighting with them
under the worst conditions.

00:07:09.901 --> 00:07:10.663
Well, whatever.

00:07:11.002 --> 00:07:14.494
I'd be curious to see
how she makes a move in that situation.

00:07:14.739 --> 00:07:16.832
Are you going to test my daughter?

00:07:17.309 --> 00:07:21.809
Anyway, it’s amazing that the girl | unexpectedly
met on my journey turned out to be your daughter.

00:07:22.881 --> 00:07:24.746
lt makes me believe in fate.

00:07:25.083 --> 00:07:27.108
Seriously, what a strange coincidence.

00:07:28.086 --> 00:07:32.819
Rushing her off on a journey with a vague purpose,
then suddenly demanding her return.

00:07:33.091 --> 00:07:34.490
What do you have in mind?

00:07:34.793 --> 00:07:38.160
Wanna tell me whose idea this is?

00:07:45.603 --> 00:07:47.127
We're going on foot from here.

00:07:47.539 --> 00:07:50.030
Where exactly are you taking us?

00:07:50.241 --> 00:07:51.230
It’s midnight already.

00:07:51.376 --> 00:07:52.570
We'll be there soon.

00:07:52.944 --> 00:07:54.343
Just follow me.

00:07:56.214 --> 00:07:59.250
Hey, we’ve been walking for over an hour already.

00:07:59.250 --> 00:08:00.842
We're almost there.

00:08:01.219 --> 00:08:05.815
We have no map. There’s no way
we'll get there with your sense of direction.

00:08:05.991 --> 00:08:08.789
Idiot. As if a map would be useful for this woman.

00:08:09.227 --> 00:08:13.823
Don’t worry. | used to play around here all the time.

00:08:15.166 --> 00:08:15.825
Look!

00:08:16.401 --> 00:08:17.663
We're here, gentlemen.

00:08:17.836 --> 00:08:18.825
This is our destination.

00:08:19.504 --> 00:08:23.531
This is where Rahzenshia Rose
was reborn as Rahzel.

00:08:24.042 --> 00:08:25.066
Rahzel-chan?

00:08:25.443 --> 00:08:27.809
| wanted you to see it.

00:08:28.246 --> 00:08:31.181
Rahzenshia? Is that your real name?

00:08:31.416 --> 00:08:35.079
The one you had before your real father
abandoned you and Serateed found you?

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:36.254
Hey, shhh.

00:08:36.254 --> 00:08:40.625
| guess you told Alzeid
about my past, Heat-tan.

00:08:40.625 --> 00:08:41.819
Um, sorry.

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:43.650
Apology accepted.

00:08:43.962 --> 00:08:45.930
I’m a mature woman today.

00:08:46.564 --> 00:08:48.464
There’s a small village up ahead.

00:08:48.666 --> 00:08:53.103
Vernini, where Alzeid tried to go
find a clue for his revenge,

00:08:53.104 --> 00:08:55.806
and it’s known for people
with black hair and blue eyes.

00:08:55.807 --> 00:08:57.399
That’s where | was born.

00:08:58.076 --> 00:09:00.567
If you already know what happened,
it makes it easy.

00:09:03.181 --> 00:09:08.551
This is the story of
what happened after | killed my mother.

00:09:11.222 --> 00:09:14.316
Don’t go anywhere until Daddy comes back, okay?

00:09:14.592 --> 00:09:16.059
Okay, I'll be waiting.

00:09:16.261 --> 00:09:19.253
Just like this, | stood in the circle and waited.

00:09:19.597 --> 00:09:20.859
For your daddy to return?

00:09:21.099 --> 00:09:21.895
Nope.

00:09:23.501 --> 00:09:25.992
For me... to die.

00:09:27.839 --> 00:09:29.568
Oh? | see.

00:09:30.008 --> 00:09:31.976
If you don’t care about your own life, I'll take it.

00:09:32.744 --> 00:09:35.042
ll keep you, Rahzenshia.

00:09:35.413 --> 00:09:38.177
Then, | saw the hand that reached out to me.

00:09:38.817 --> 00:09:41.081
And that was Serateed?

00:09:41.419 --> 00:09:44.047
I think so, but...

00:09:44.923 --> 00:09:47.585
| have only a vague memory of it.

00:09:48.593 --> 00:09:53.587
So, long story short,
my father Serateed found me and now here | am.

00:09:54.599 --> 00:10:01.061
Rahzenshia died right here, leaving her
unforgivable sin and her heartache to Rahzel.

00:10:01.439 --> 00:10:04.975
Don’t you want to see your real father again?

00:10:04.976 --> 00:10:07.968
The man in that village is Rahzenshia’s father.

00:10:08.346 --> 00:10:10.837
He isn’t my, Rahzel’s, family.

00:10:11.616 --> 00:10:13.846
Actually, it was my birthday.

00:10:14.719 --> 00:10:18.120
My mom was excited about
the three of us celebrating it together.

00:10:18.590 --> 00:10:23.653
She prepared a feast, | wore a dress she had made,
and we waited for Daddy to come home.

00:10:30.301 --> 00:10:33.270
As the date changed, she lost her mind.

00:10:34.272 --> 00:10:39.642
| still think that if Daddy had come home that night,
it wouldn't have ended that way.

00:10:40.445 --> 00:10:42.709
And you know the rest of the story.

00:10:43.314 --> 00:10:44.781
Don’t give me that look.

00:10:46.317 --> 00:10:48.877
| didn’t mean to make you feel sad.

00:10:49.354 --> 00:10:53.814
And obviously, | didn’t have anyone
to celebrate my birthday that day.

00:10:54.459 --> 00:10:57.053
Then again, | brought it on myself, more or less.

00:10:57.462 --> 00:11:00.898
Wait... | don’t even know what I’m talking about.

00:11:01.266 --> 00:11:04.861
In a nutshell, today on my fifteenth birthday,

00:11:05.069 --> 00:11:09.938
the fact that you two are here with me
to celebrate it is the greatest present ever.

00:11:10.542 --> 00:11:13.204
Jeez, it makes me blush to say it out loud.

00:11:13.478 --> 00:11:14.467
Rahzel-chan.

00:11:17.315 --> 00:11:20.807
Alzeid, Baroqueheat, | love you guys!

00:11:21.286 --> 00:11:23.811
It was only a short while,
but thank you for all your help.

00:11:24.422 --> 00:11:28.324
Please write me letters.
Ill write, too. Lots of them.

00:11:29.060 --> 00:11:31.290
Are you going back with Serateed?

00:11:31.663 --> 00:11:32.857
Yeah, | am.

00:11:33.231 --> 00:11:37.258
| owe him for saving and raising me,
so | couldn’t possibly disobey him.

00:11:37.735 --> 00:11:39.566
No matter how unreasonable it may sound,

00:11:39.804 --> 00:11:45.071
ll obey if he has good enough reason
to disregard my wishes and pride.

00:11:45.944 --> 00:11:47.571
And you'll just leave your comrades behind?

00:11:48.179 --> 00:11:52.479
Just like you have your own path,
| have my own.

00:11:54.385 --> 00:11:56.580
This is where my journey ends.

00:11:57.222 --> 00:11:59.087
Thank you. | couldn’t have had a better time.

00:11:59.591 --> 00:12:01.081
Shall we head back to the hotel?

00:12:10.435 --> 00:12:12.926
Huh? You can’t find Alzeid?

00:12:13.838 --> 00:12:15.271
Isn't it odd?

00:12:15.506 --> 00:12:18.907
That sleepyhead left before everyone else woke up.

00:12:19.244 --> 00:12:23.044
| have a feeling he’s gone to buy
a present for your birthday, Rahzel-chan.

00:12:23.348 --> 00:12:24.838
But it’s time for me to—

00:12:25.216 --> 00:12:28.879
Are you ready now?
The train is leaving soon.

00:12:33.558 --> 00:12:38.393
So, for the sake of my pride,
| must choose the most amazing present.

00:12:38.696 --> 00:12:39.788
Do something about it, Shopkeeper.

00:12:40.031 --> 00:12:43.626
Right. And what kind of item are you looking for?

00:12:43.968 --> 00:12:45.868
Like, something incredible.

00:12:46.037 --> 00:12:48.801
Could you be a little more specific, Sir?

00:12:49.140 --> 00:12:51.472
Something shocking to celebrate a birthday.

00:12:51.743 --> 00:12:55.076
“Shocking” may not be such a good idea, Sir.

00:12:57.849 --> 00:13:01.808
Something that makes her remember me
every time she sees it, even if we’re far apart.

00:13:03.454 --> 00:13:09.051
Excuse me. Could you gift-wrap
the item in the show window?

00:13:09.727 --> 00:13:10.421
Of course.

00:13:11.029 --> 00:13:14.658
A present? For a birthday? For whom?
What’s their age and gender?

00:13:15.566 --> 00:13:17.431
Is this some kind of interrogation?

00:13:17.702 --> 00:13:20.694
Okay, which item in the window would you like?

00:13:21.039 --> 00:13:22.740
It’s a birthday present.

00:13:22.740 --> 00:13:25.876
She would have turned fifteen yesterday.

00:13:25.877 --> 00:13:26.673
"She would have?"

00:13:27.078 --> 00:13:29.638
It’s for my daughter that | left a long time ago.

00:13:29.881 --> 00:13:30.848
Oh?

00:13:30.848 --> 00:13:32.916
Um, you don’t care about the rest?

00:13:32.917 --> 00:13:35.681
If you don’t mind, could you tell me instead?

00:13:35.887 --> 00:13:38.014
She was such a bright girl.

00:13:38.389 --> 00:13:44.123
She also had special magical abilities,
such as being able to fly in the air or start a fire.

00:13:44.329 --> 00:13:46.230
That’s magnificent.

00:13:46.230 --> 00:13:46.930
Isn't it?

00:13:46.931 --> 00:13:48.193
I’m very proud of her.

00:13:48.499 --> 00:13:53.027
With my beautiful wife and adorable daughter,
| was really happy back then.

00:13:55.573 --> 00:13:56.407
Hey, Shopkeeper...

00:13:56.407 --> 00:13:57.608
...IS this for sale, too?

00:13:57.608 --> 00:14:01.745
Oh my! That’s a famous sheep,
Serateeko-chan, from the vegetable store next door.

00:14:01.746 --> 00:14:03.907
Hm? What an annoying name. Shoo!

00:14:05.083 --> 00:14:06.175
Serateeko-chan!

00:14:07.418 --> 00:14:08.852
Serateeko-chan!

00:14:08.853 --> 00:14:10.921
Um... may | continue?

00:14:10.922 --> 00:14:12.823
What color would you like for a ribbon?

00:14:12.824 --> 00:14:14.553
Feels like | keep getting tantalized.

00:14:16.327 --> 00:14:19.057
Is it just me or did | get in his way?

00:14:19.530 --> 00:14:21.555
| have no comment on that matter.

00:14:21.999 --> 00:14:25.833
Farewells always come unexpectedly.

00:14:26.137 --> 00:14:29.073
Perhaps that man would never have imagined

00:14:29.073 --> 00:14:32.736
a day that he would be separated
from his loving daughter.

00:14:33.344 --> 00:14:35.879
You know the saying
“Once in a lifetime encounter’?

00:14:35.880 --> 00:14:40.317
You never know when the farewell comes,
and you may never see each other again.

00:14:40.318 --> 00:14:44.818
So, you just have to treasure
each and every moment together.

00:14:44.856 --> 00:14:51.557
And eventually, the moments you shared together
become a more precious gift than anything else.

00:14:52.296 --> 00:14:54.764
Did you find what you were looking for?

00:14:56.300 --> 00:14:58.359
Don’t try to fool me by answering
a question with another question.

00:15:02.039 --> 00:15:03.028
Hello?

00:15:03.608 --> 00:15:05.701
Could we get a present with these?

00:15:06.244 --> 00:15:09.577
Sure. Is it a gift for someone special?

00:15:14.185 --> 00:15:18.383
On the day my wife fell ill,
our happy days came to an end.

00:15:19.590 --> 00:15:22.684
With an incurable illness,
she could only wait for death to come.

00:15:23.361 --> 00:15:28.628
Since she had the ability to forsee the future,
she probably knew her days were numbered.

00:15:29.934 --> 00:15:32.732
Every day, she was slowly losing her mind.

00:15:33.137 --> 00:15:34.468
You’re dying, you know?

00:15:34.639 --> 00:15:35.973
What are you talking about, Irilia?

00:15:35.973 --> 00:15:38.464
So, you don’t need to feel sorry for me.

00:15:39.110 --> 00:15:42.511
You are all more pitiful than | am.

00:15:44.449 --> 00:15:46.644
Each and every one of you will die!

00:15:46.851 --> 00:15:50.446
Being driven away, ridiculed,
stepped on, and torn up...

00:15:50.688 --> 00:15:54.458
When you finally ask yourself why,
you’re squished like a bug.

00:15:54.459 --> 00:15:55.687
Just like a bug!

00:15:57.395 --> 00:15:58.487
Irilia!

00:15:59.697 --> 00:16:00.994
That’s what you deserve.

00:16:01.199 --> 00:16:03.690
Seeing my sweet wife change so dramatically,

00:16:04.068 --> 00:16:09.938
and seeing my overly brilliant daughter
for who she was, | became frightened by them.

00:16:11.075 --> 00:16:16.274
Ultimately, it was my weakness
that brought the tragedy.

00:16:17.582 --> 00:16:24.249
| know this is no excuse, but | did go back
for my daughter whom | had left behind.

00:16:25.356 --> 00:16:29.452
However, she was already gone.

00:16:30.328 --> 00:16:34.025
| searched everywhere through the night,
but | had no luck.

00:16:34.565 --> 00:16:35.691
| want to believe...

00:16:37.401 --> 00:16:40.529
| want to believe that
| can see you once again, Rahzenshia.

00:16:45.476 --> 00:16:48.206
Baroqueheat, are you going with Alzeid?

00:16:48.579 --> 00:16:50.774
Yeah, | still have a few
unfinished things to take care of.

00:16:51.682 --> 00:16:53.547
Everyone has their own circumstances, huh?

00:16:54.118 --> 00:16:58.111
| wanted to get to know you
a lot better, Baroqueheat.

00:16:58.556 --> 00:17:01.286
Don’t make it sound like
we'll never see each other again.

00:17:01.559 --> 00:17:02.992
I'll come see you, | promise.

00:17:03.160 --> 00:17:04.149
ll be counting on you.

00:17:06.898 --> 00:17:07.728
Rahzel.

00:17:09.767 --> 00:17:11.962
Well, give my regards to Alzeid.

00:17:21.445 --> 00:17:25.945
Koboreru kioku sotto atsumete
Gathering my memories that are spilling outward

00:17:29.687 --> 00:17:33.824
Sugiyuku jikan ni usureteku itami
As time passes by, the pain starts to fade

00:17:33.824 --> 00:17:35.392
Sore ga setsunai
What sweet sorrow

00:17:35.393 --> 00:17:38.028
As long as you don’t forget, that’s all that matters?
Sore ga setsunai
What sweet sorrow

00:17:38.029 --> 00:17:42.529
Misenai ienal kesenai himitsu wa
The secret that cannot be seen, told, or erased

00:17:43.334 --> 00:17:46.470
As long as you remember at times
and long for the old days?
Misenai ienai kesenai himitsu wa
The secret that cannot be seen, told, or erased

00:17:46.470 --> 00:17:50.440
Dare ni demo aru to ima nara omoeru yo
Now | realize that is what everyone has

00:17:50.441 --> 00:17:52.568
Dakara
The more | know

00:17:53.578 --> 00:17:55.446
Yasashiku nareru no
The kinder | will be

00:17:55.446 --> 00:17:56.547
That’s bullshit.
Yasashiku nareru no
The kinder | will be

00:17:56.547 --> 00:17:58.815
| refuse to become just her sweet memory.
Yasashiku nareru no
The kinder | will be

00:17:58.816 --> 00:18:06.723
Dare mo shiranai miral sagaso
Let’s find the future no one has found

00:18:06.958 --> 00:18:14.888
Genkai no saki ni atarashii michi ga kitto hirakeru
A new path will open for you beyond the limit

00:18:15.099 --> 00:18:16.567
Hold on to this, Dad.
Kimi sae shiranai kimi o sagasu yo
You will find a part of yourself that you are not yet aware of

00:18:16.567 --> 00:18:18.101
Huh? W-wait, Rahzel!
Kimi sae shiranai kimi o sagasu yo
You will find a part of yourself that you are not yet aware of

00:18:18.102 --> 00:18:23.130
Kimi sae shiranai kimi o sagasu yo
You will find a part of yourself that you are not yet aware of

00:18:23.341 --> 00:18:25.476
Utsumuku yokogao
With your profile looking downward

00:18:25.476 --> 00:18:29.640
Kakusareta itami sotto
And pain that’s quietly hidden

00:18:30.615 --> 00:18:35.086
| will take you... take you as you are

00:18:35.086 --> 00:18:36.720
I’m not gonna write a letter!
| will take you... take you as you are

00:18:36.721 --> 00:18:37.588
| will take you... take you as you are

00:18:37.588 --> 00:18:40.057
I’m not gonna come see you,
let alone remember you!
| will take you... take you as you are

00:18:40.057 --> 00:18:44.517
If you aren’t right beside me,
ll never keep you in my heart even for a moment!

00:18:45.630 --> 00:18:49.361
If you’re going farther away,
you’re no longer my comrade!

00:19:00.478 --> 00:19:01.467
l-idiot!

00:19:01.746 --> 00:19:03.976
Stop kidding yourself!

00:19:15.926 --> 00:19:18.053
Are you out of your mind, Rahzel-chan?

00:19:18.362 --> 00:19:19.429
That was just—

00:19:19.430 --> 00:19:23.196
Alzeid, how dare you talk to me like that!

00:19:23.734 --> 00:19:27.534
Was | the only one who considered us comrades?

00:19:28.673 --> 00:19:29.731
Comrades...

00:19:30.641 --> 00:19:33.269
Do comrades remain comrades
even if they’re physically far apart?

00:19:34.378 --> 00:19:35.276
They do.

00:19:35.780 --> 00:19:37.839
Even if they never see each other again?

00:19:38.315 --> 00:19:42.911
Even if they can’t share happiness,
or support each other during the tough times?

00:19:43.521 --> 00:19:45.155
Even if they have no way to tell
one another where they are,

00:19:45.156 --> 00:19:48.717
or how their lives are treating them,
are they still comrades?

00:19:49.160 --> 00:19:50.127
They still are!

00:19:50.428 --> 00:19:51.162
That’s bullshit.

00:19:51.162 --> 00:19:53.153
It gives absolutely no consolation.

00:19:53.497 --> 00:19:54.828
| don’t need that.

00:19:57.234 --> 00:19:58.861
Then, what do you want from me’?!

00:19:59.103 --> 00:20:02.706
You want me to continue my journey with you,
ignoring my father?!

00:20:02.707 --> 00:20:05.073
There’s no way | can do that!

00:20:06.110 --> 00:20:08.044
But | know you don’t want to go back.

00:20:08.679 --> 00:20:11.079
You want to stay so bad that you burst into tears.

00:20:11.782 --> 00:20:14.148
Here’s a one-day-late birthday present for you.

00:20:14.585 --> 00:20:15.677
ll give you a chance.

00:20:16.487 --> 00:20:18.421
Just bite the bullet and confront
that goddamn dictator.

00:20:18.723 --> 00:20:20.816
"Goddamn dictator"? Are you referring to me?

00:20:21.158 --> 00:20:23.683
Try and obtain his permission
to continue our journey.

00:20:24.061 --> 00:20:25.995
You're ignoring me? I'll smack you.

00:20:26.297 --> 00:20:27.631
But that’s not—

00:20:27.631 --> 00:20:29.032
You’re giving up before even trying?

00:20:29.033 --> 00:20:29.931
What a shame.

00:20:30.067 --> 00:20:32.058
| don’t need a coward like that as my comrade.

00:20:34.605 --> 00:20:37.073
Don’t act so bossy.
How dare you talk to me like that?

00:20:48.719 --> 00:20:50.152
rll accept that challenge.

00:20:50.721 --> 00:20:55.488
I’m going to make your damn boring life
more fun and amusing for you!

00:20:56.093 --> 00:20:57.060
Bang!

00:21:05.970 --> 00:21:07.733
Wh-who the hell are you?

00:21:07.905 --> 00:21:11.033
What a surprise. | thought
everyone here was dead.

00:21:11.275 --> 00:21:15.746
The very man who ruined
the village has managed to survive...

00:21:15.746 --> 00:21:17.514
Me? What do you-—

00:21:17.515 --> 00:21:19.449
But I'll be sure to finish it right now.

00:21:20.117 --> 00:21:24.178
Rest in peace, Fabien Rose.

00:21:26.924 --> 00:21:29.051
When the journey is over,
the days of challenge begin.

00:21:31.395 --> 00:21:34.626
Now, Rahzel, it’s time for the game.

00:21:43.674 --> 00:21:47.344
Tonari no heya kara
As | hear the sound of laughter

00:21:47.344 --> 00:21:50.973
Waraigoe ga suru
Coming from the room next door

00:21:51.148 --> 00:21:58.350
Ussura mezameru asa ga konna ni Itoshii
| slowly wake up to the morning that | adore

00:21:58.722 --> 00:22:05.958
Dokoka de yumemita ichimai no e ni wa
Somewhere | dreamed of a painting

00:22:06.230 --> 00:22:13.534
Mou anata no isu wo kakitashita bakari da yo
| just painted a new chair for you

00:22:13.704 --> 00:22:18.204
Kanashii monogatari ga ima
Even if the sorrowful story

00:22:20.644 --> 00:22:29.348
Curtain no mukogawa machibuse shite itemo
Is lying in wait beyond the curtain

00:22:31.355 --> 00:22:38.591
Ashita ni wa mishiranu hito no yoni nattemo
Even if we may feel like strangers tomorrow

00:22:38.863 --> 00:22:45.996
Anata ga koko ni iru tashika na kiseki wo shinjite
| believe in the perfect miracle that you'll still be here

00:22:46.303 --> 00:22:53.641
Sashidasareta te ni wa wakare no yokan mo naku
The hand you reached out shows no sign of parting

00:22:53.978 --> 00:23:01.714
Tada dakishimetakute ima ruisen ga yurunda
As | grow teary-eyed, | just want to hold you now
